msgid "You're good..."
msgstr "E-eres fuertote..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "100_Sexy Gal"
msgid "Sorry about that, mister. Chi-kun has a really short fuse."
msgstr "Perdone por eso, señor. Chi-kun se irrita con facilidad."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "112_Sexy Gal"
msgid "Now, what do you say to the nice man, Chi-kun?"
msgstr "¿Algo qué decir, Chi-kun?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "124_Yakuza"
msgid "Sorry! My bad!"
msgstr "¡Lo sientooo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "136_Sexy Gal"
msgid "Can I make it up to you? I'll hear you out on that hostess thing."
msgstr "¿Cómo puedo compensarlo? Estoy dispuesta a escuchar sobre el trabajo en ese club."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "148_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure thing! I'll get in touch with you later, then."
msgstr "¡Me encantaría! Te llamaré más tarde."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "220_Akiyama"
msgid "Hello there. I'm a scout for a hostess club."
msgstr "Mucho gusto, soy reclutador de un hostess club."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "232_Sexy Gal"
msgid "Hehe. Little old to be a scout, don't you think?"
msgstr "Je, je, je. ¿Un poco viejo para ser reclutador, no cree?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "244_Akiyama"
msgid "Hahaha! You got me there. Believe it or not, I'm actually\\r\nonly thirty-two... So, do you already have a position\\r\nsomewhere else?"
msgstr "¡Ja, ja, ja! Eso me ofende. Aunque no lo crea, solo tengo treinta y dos años... ¿Trabaja en algún otro club?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "256_Yakuza"
msgid "Uh-huh, at a club in Roppongi."
msgstr "Así es. De hecho, trabajo en un club de Roppongi."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "268_Akiyama"
msgid "No wonder! I knew there was something about you. Ever give\\r\nany thought to switching clubs?"
msgstr "¡No me sorprende! Tienes esa chispa tan especial. ¿Alguna vez pensaste en cambiar de club?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "280_Yakuza"
msgid "Well, actually..."
msgstr "Ahora que lo dices..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "292_Yakuza"
msgid "Hey, you!"
msgstr "¡¡Oye, tú!!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Bas
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "304_Yakuza"
msgid "Whaddya doin' talkin' to my girl?"
msgstr "¿Qué haces hablando con mi chica?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "316_Yakuza"
msgid "Hi, Chi-kun. I've been waiting forever!"
msgstr "Ah, hola, Chi-kun. ¡Llegas tarde!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "328_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, so she's with you. I was just hoping she might want to\\r\ngive our club a try."
msgstr "Oh, ¿así que ustedes están saliendo? Y no te preocupes, solo quería que le diera un intento a nuestro club, tranquilo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "340_Yakuza"
msgid "Are you shittin' me, pal? I should chop off yer finger for\\r\nthat!"
msgstr "¿Te estás burlando de mí, imbécil? ¡¡Prepara ese meñique!!"

